This artifact commits to the diagnosis that the implementation of conformance.kernel.recovery diverges from the documented rule regarding scoring priority between fenced and bare objects. It commits to the validity of proposal 59fc20fd3c22d623 as evidence that bare objects after fences incorrectly override fenced content. It commits to the necessity of executing the three proposed test scenarios to isolate the discrepancy and guide subsequent proposals toward resolving the rule-code mismatch.